<title>TANZANIA: Tanzania shilling weakens on dollar.</title>
<headline>Tanzania shilling weakens on dollar.</headline>
<dateline>DAR ES SALAAM 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tanzanian shilling weakened against the dollar on Wednesday but strengthened marginally against the pound.</p>
<p>The shilling exchanged at a commercial mean rate of 599.0490 to the dollar compared to Friday's 598.9401. Against the pound, the shilling traded at a mean rate of 980.0472 compared with 980.5878 on Friday.</p>
<p>The foreign exchange market was closed on Monday and Tuesday for a public holiday.</p>
